no separator           | 'x: abc#def'           -> {'x': 'abc'}
with space             | 'x: abc #def'          -> {'x': 'abc'}
full-line comment      | '# comment\\nx: 1'     -> {'x': 1}
hash inside quotes     | 'x: "ab#cd"'           -> {'x': 'ab#cd'}
hash in key            | 'a#b: 1'               -> "ValueError: params YAML line 1: unsupported node 'a' (outside the frozen APEX params subset)"
hash in flow           | 'x: {a: b#c, d: 1}'    -> "ValueError: unterminated flow map: '{a: b'"

real YAML 1.2: a '#' not preceded by whitespace is part of the plain scalar

== '#' inside values of real params files? ==
decision_runtime_v1.yaml     no '#' inside quoted values
